  "slug": "my-big-family",
  "audio_url": "/audio/russian/20380_my-big-family.mp3",
  "english_paragraphs": [
    "I have a big family. My father is a middle school teacher and my mother is a nurse. They are both retired now. I have no biological brothers or sisters, I am an only child. But I'm not alone, because I have two cousins ​​and three cousins, and we grew up together very happily. I used to be a civil servant, but after I had children, I became a housewife. My spouse is a foreigner, works in an IT company, and is a programmer. He has three brothers. His eldest brother is very smart and is a university professor. His second brother is very tall and an athlete. His younger brother is still a student and is currently studying at university while working part-time. My father-in-law is a bank clerk, and my mother-in-law is a supermarket salesperson. They are both in their seventies now and are still working. How is your family?"
  ],
  "english_full": "I have a big family. My father is a middle school teacher and my mother is a nurse. They are both retired now. I have no biological brothers or sisters, I am an only child. But I'm not alone, because I have two cousins ​​and three cousins, and we grew up together very happily. I used to be a civil servant, but after I had children, I became a housewife. My spouse is a foreigner, works in an IT company, and is a programmer. He has three brothers. His eldest brother is very smart and is a university professor. His second brother is very tall and an athlete. His younger brother is still a student and is currently studying at university while working part-time. My father-in-law is a bank clerk, and my mother-in-law is a supermarket salesperson. They are both in their seventies now and are still working. How is your family?",
  "russian_paragraphs": [
    "У меня́ большо́й семя́. Мой ба́тя — наста́вник в сре́дней школе́, а ма́ма — фе́льдшер. Они́ обе́ оба́ отставно́й ны́не. У меня́ нет биологи́ческих бра́тов или сестёр, я еди́нственный ребёнок. Но я не оди́н, потому что у меня́ есть двою́родные ку́зины и три́ ку́зена, и мы вы́росли вме́сте сча́стливо."
  ],
  "reading_paragraphs": [
    "U menyá bol'shóy semíya. Moy bátya — nastav́nik v sérdney shkóle, a máma — félder. Oní obé obá otstavnóy nýne. U menyá net biologícheskikh brátov ili seśtyor, ya edínstvennyy rébenok. No ya ne odín, potomu chto u menyá yest' dvoýurodnyye kuźiny i trí kuźena, i my výrosli vḿeste schastlivó."
  ],
